This program can be intalled in DLG, do like this:

- In Sysop Sub-System go to Configure Menus
- Select the menu you want to add the program in.
- Then use Add Item

letter? "C" or whatever you want to use
description? ANSI-chess
command-type? 1
name of executable? write the path where chess is located
then
Y (reload menu)
N (CTRL-c)
N (CTRL-d)
Y (linefeed)
Y (echo, this important)
Y (killing)
Y (pending)
N (pass-thru)
Y (pausing)
Y (raw-mode)
Y (time-outs)
Y (verbose pause)
Y (line freezing)

user-level, well decide yourself ;)

now you should be able to play it, good luck!
